By Vieta's formulas, \begin{align*}
r^2 + s^2 + t^2 &= (r + s + t)^2 - 2(rs + rt + st) = a^2 - 2b, \\
r^2 \cdot s^2 + r^2 \cdot t^2 + s^2 \cdot t^2 &= (rs + rt + st)^2 - 2rst(r + s + t) = b^2 - 2a, \\
r^2 \cdot s^2 \cdot t^2 &= (rst)^2 = 1.
