Place the cube in coordinate space, so that the vertices are at $(x,y,z),$ where $x,$ $y,$ $z \in \{0,1\}.$  We cut off the tetrahedron with vertices $(0,1,1),$ $(1,0,1),$ $(1,1,0),$ and $(1,1,1).$

